# KCoin

KCoin is a simplified blockchain application that demonstrates core blockchain concepts — proof-of-work mining, wallet management, and peer-to-peer transactions. Users can register a wallet, mine blocks to earn KCoin, send KCoin to other wallets, and explore the full blockchain history in real time.

Built with NestJS and Next.js.

---

## How It Works

- Register an account and receive a unique wallet address
- Mine blocks using proof-of-work (SHA-256) to earn 10 KCoin per block
- Send KCoin to any wallet address — transactions sit in a pending pool until mined
- Every mined block confirms pending transactions and adds them permanently to the chain
- View the full blockchain history in the explorer — every block, hash, and transaction

---

## Backend

Built with NestJS, MongoDB, and JWT authentication.

cd backend
yarn install
yarn start:dev


Runs on `http://localhost:3000`



## Frontend

Built with Next.js, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, and TanStack Query.
cd frontend
yarn install
yarn dev


Runs on `http://localhost:3001`
